on FreeBSD and OpenZFS. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
supported by iXsystems. TrueNAS and FreeNAS are trademarks of iXsystems,
Inc.; they are used here only to describe the origin of the code.

Principal components and their licenses:

  Operating system base          FreeBSD (stable/15)
                                 BSD 2-Clause; see /COPYRIGHT
  OpenZFS                        CDDL-1.0
                                 installed as the openzfs package
  Middleware (middlewared)       GNU LGPL version 3
                                 Copyright iXsystems, Inc. and contributors
  Web interface                  GNU GPL version 3
                                 Copyright iXsystems, Inc. and contributors
  Build system                   GNU GPL version 3
  zettarepl (ZFS replication)    GNU GPL version 3

Ports and packages installed on top of the base system carry their own
licenses; the full text of each is installed under
/usr/local/share/licenses/<package>/.

Written offer of source code
----------------------------

The complete corresponding source code for the components above, including
every modification made by this project, is published at:

    https://github.com/bsdnas

  os           the FreeBSD fork the base system is built from
  middleware   middlewared, the ports that build it and the files it ships
  webui        the web interface
  core-build   the build system that produces the images
  pkgtools     the update mechanism inherited from the upstream project

